<title>USA: TABLE - Chemed Corp Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Chemed Corp Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.63		    $0.58</p>
<p> Net			  6,292		    5,688</p>
<p> Revs		     182,717		  170,471</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,035		    9,837</p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.48		    $1.82</p>
<p> Net			 14,779		   17,885</p>
<p> Revs		     351,269		  337,932</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,018		    9,852</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Income from continuing operations $0.57 vs $0.58 for Q2 and $1.42 vs $1.82 for six months period.</p>
<p>1997 Q2 and six months include $598,000 discontinued operations gain.</p>
<p>Q2 amounts include aftertax capital gains of $0.20 a share in 1997 and 1996 from the sale of investments.</p>
<p>Six month periods include aftertax capital gains of $0.77 in 1997 and $1.11 in 1996 from the sale of investments.</p>
